# Household load/solar export - private, not for publication.
# This repo is a fork of a public upstream and is therefore public itself. A year of hourly
# household load is occupancy data: it shows when the house is empty, when we sleep and
# which weeks we were away. The code that BUILDS these files is committed; the files are not.
# Regenerate with clean_backtest_csv.py / influx_to_backtest_csv.py, and copy them to the
# NAS out of band, the same way price_cache/ is handled.
backtest_input_hourly.csv
backtest_input_hourly_clean.csv
backtest_input_hourly_clean.excluded.json
backtest_influx_*.csv
backtest_p1_*.csv
backtest_p1_*.excluded.json

# Backtest run outputs - the "use" column is the same household load data
results-raw-baseline/

